      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like, if there really is no plan and no meaning... then everything i do, every struggle i go through, it's all just fake. it feels like i'm just playing a part in a play that doesn't even have an audience. why even bother trying to keep going when the outcome is just more of this nothingness?",
